  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 3-3\\cdot 5)i-(1\\cdot 3-2\\cdot 3)j+(1\\cdot 5-2\\cdot 0)k \\\\  & =(0-15)i-(3-6)j+(5-0)k \\\\  & =\u27e8-15,3,5\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
